{"text": "Announcement for Niskayuna teaching and administrative staff\n\nOpportunity for travel and employment abroad\n\nThe Wisdom Educational Group currently runs the leading Montessori school (PK-\n6) in Beijing, China. In September 2018, they will open a new middle school campus\nwhere Chinese and international students will receive a middle school education\nbased on an American curriculum. A new high school campus is scheduled to open\nin 2020. The language of instruction is English.\n\nLocation:\n\nTerm of employment:\n\nSalary:\n\nBenefits:\n\nNeeded:\n\nPlease note:\n\nBeijing, China\nBeijing Montessori School\n\nSeptember to June, full year\n\nNTA step\nSupplemental income from Wisdom in addition to\nhousing stipend\n\nMedical insurance plan\nHousing stipend\nAssistance with transportation to / from work\nTravel expenses to / from US paid\nProfessional development opportunities\nFamily members are welcome to accompany teacher\nTuition-free attendance at Beijing Montessori for\nteacher\u2019s children\n\nExperienced teachers of all subjects, grades 7-12\n\nNiskayuna teachers that choose to participate will\nretain seniority, benefits and retirement status as an\nemployee of the Niskayuna Central School District on\nspecial assignment.",
